{"3858990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Watertight", "steam_appid": 3858990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watertight is a short psychological-horror experience set aboard a 1950s deep-sea submarine.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles to restore your submarine’s critical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the submarine’s cramped, flooded corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror ambience that amplifies claustrophobia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A concise, intense experience designed to be finished in 30 minutes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trapped in a failing submarine with systems on the brink of collapse. Complete a series of critical repair tasks to restore power, life-support, and navigation and hope you survive long enough to realize you’re not alone in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan Spedden was just seven years old when he survived the Titanic’s sinking. Both of his parents were lost to the icy depths. Consumed by survivor’s guilt and a lifelong obsession to uncover the wreck, he poured decades into research and planning. In 1952, he abandons everything he holds dear to captain a one-man submarine into the abyss. What he discovers deep beneath the ocean may finally answer his questions… or destroy what’s left of his sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watertight is a short psychological-horror experience set aboard a 1950s deep-sea submarine.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles to restore your submarine’s critical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the submarine’s cramped, flooded corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror ambience that amplifies claustrophobia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A concise, intense experience designed to be finished in 30 minutes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trapped in a failing submarine with systems on the brink of collapse. Complete a series of critical repair tasks to restore power, life-support, and navigation and hope you survive long enough to realize you’re not alone in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan Spedden was just seven years old when he survived the Titanic’s sinking. Both of his parents were lost to the icy depths. Consumed by survivor’s guilt and a lifelong obsession to uncover the wreck, he poured decades into research and planning. In 1952, he abandons everything he holds dear to captain a one-man submarine into the abyss. What he discovers deep beneath the ocean may finally answer his questions… or destroy what’s left of his sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A short first-person horror game. An accident cripples your submarine while trying to f